Subject: Never set the receiver volume

The sender sent "volume: 0.000000" twice at SETUP when audio was on, and
unmute sent it again. 0 dB is full scale in AirPlay. Samsung TVs map AirPlay
volume onto the TV speaker volume, so one test session left a 2018 Samsung
(UNU710D) at volume 100. Drop the setup SET_PARAMETER, make SetAudioMuted
refuse, and update the tests. Applies on top of 0001. LGPL-3.0-or-later, as
upstream.

